# Edith, Ancient Guard

> Edith is not a tank. She is a two-stage fighter who charges in mech form and discharges in marksman form, and every point of extra defense she stacks becomes magic power the second she ejects. Pick her when your draft has one reliable physical carry, a second initiator to split aggro, and the patience to wait for a lengthy ultimate to come back online.

