### EXP Default Flicker (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Oracle, Dominance Ice, Feather of Heaven, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Oracle, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Antique Cuirass over Feather of Heaven when Use when physical skill burst reaches Edith before she can charge Wrath and take flight.; Athena's Shield over Feather of Heaven when Use against one-rotation magic burst that can force Primal Wrath too early.; Radiant Armor over Feather of Heaven when Use against repeated magic poke, burn, or DPS that keeps hitting Edith through extended fights.
- Total cost: 10540 gold

Default EXP setup that turns Edith's defensive purchases into Primal Wrath damage while keeping one attack-speed item for flight-form finishing.

